- `npm run build:server`                      -> exit 0 (dist/server.cjs, pdf worker copied)
- `(cd packages/web && npx next build)`       -> exit 0 (compiled, static pages)
- `npm run check:encoding`                    -> OK (no BOM, no mojibake, all JSON valid)
- `node --import tsx --test src/learning/harness/__tests__/experienceStore.test.ts`
                                             -> tests 15, pass 15, fail 0

## Files
- `.jdone` only (one reworded line + this report). No source file was modified by this
  session; the H2 deliverables are unchanged from commit `446de33`.

