# Merge with manus-parity `61aca0c` (N9): `.jdone` add/add resolved

`git merge manus-parity` conflicted in exactly ONE file: `.jdone` (add/add: this branch's
O8 report vs parity's accumulated rollup, which N9 had restored to the tracked tree via
`f159cbb`). Every source file auto-merged cleanly, so no code, test or prompt was touched by
the resolution.

