## V8 gate-fix session (round 12): root-cause fix for the recurring `.jdone` parity conflict

**Root cause.** `.jdone` is an append-only runner rollup that both sides keep tracked:
this worktree appends its own reports and `manus-parity` carries an equivalent file of
its own (every sibling workstream appends to it). A normal three-way merge therefore
conflicts in essentially every region, so each parity merge demanded a hand-resolve of
dozens of conflict hunks and repeatedly produced the same gate failure:
`MERGE CONFLICT with latest manus-parity in: .jdone. Run git merge manus-parity, resolve
those files keeping both sides, commit.`

**Fix.** Add a committed `.gitattributes` rule declaring both marker files as
`merge=union`. The union driver concatenates both sides instead of blocking, which is
exactly the intended outcome for these files: each report stays intact and the result is
a superset of both parents. `.jdone` is now union-merged automatically on every future
parity merge, so this gate failure cannot recur.

**What was merged.** `manus-parity` was a moving integration branch during this session.
It advanced from `84c9af8` to `bec4181` (which untracked the markers), then to `109617a`
(which untracked and gitignored them), and finally to `590d358` (which re-added
`.jdone` and re-stated the gitignore rationale). The final merge (`ca6b2f0`) applied the
union driver and completed with no conflict, keeping both sides.

**Resolution.** The `.jdone` add/add conflict was resolved by the union driver. Verified
by a multiset line diff against both parents: missing non-blank lines = 0 for our side
and 0 for parity's side, so no report content was lost. `.jcode-done` is unchanged
(parity does not track it). No conflict markers, no BOM, no U+FFFD, Arabic intact.

**Gates (all green on the merged tree at `ca6b2f0`).**
- `npx tsc --noEmit` -> exit 0
- `npm run build:server` -> exit 0
- `npm run check:encoding` -> OK (no BOM, no mojibake, all JSON valid)
- `npm run check:design-registry` -> OK (30 blocks, 8 RTL, all manifests valid, all built)
- V8 node suites (`src/design/__tests__/*.test.ts` + `src/tools/__tests__/uiExamples.test.ts`)
  -> 217 tests, 217 pass, 0 fail
- `(cd packages/web && npx next build)` -> exit 0, compiled successfully
- `(cd packages/web && npx vitest run)` -> 89 files, 614 tests, 614 pass, 0 fail
- Acceptance probe: `pricing` -> top 3 `["pricing-toggle","pricing-3-tier","rtl-pricing-3-tier"]`;
  Arabic `تسعير` -> same top 3 (acceptance met in both scripts)

**Final state.** `HEAD = ca6b2f0`; `git merge-base --is-ancestor manus-parity HEAD` exits 0.
Tracked marker files: `.jdone`, `.jcode-done`, `.gitattributes` (union rule). V8
