## Preserved: manus-parity O0 report (merged in from parity)

O0 complete: read-only recon for the Omnara durable event log. No source file touched.

## What was produced
`docs/re/omnara-O0.md` (359 lines, committed as `4c6be22`). Every claim carries a
`file:line` taken from this worktree at HEAD `a8130cc`. `node_modules` excluded from
all searches.

## Answers (U1-U6)
- **U1** `transaction` exists at `src/server/sqliteStore.ts:48-53`, signature
  `transaction<T>(fn: () => T): T`, uses `BEGIN IMMEDIATE`, and is **NOT re-entrant**
  (a nested call throws `cannot start a transaction within a transaction`). BUILD_SPEC
  U2 is answered "no nesting" (decision B). The `metadata` table exists at
  `src/server/sqliteStore.ts:18` but **`getMeta`/`setMeta` are NOT exported**; only
  private copies exist (`src/server/credits.ts:98-105`, `src/server/assets.ts:52-58`),
  so O2 must add them.
- **U2** replay is driven by `join_session`, not a `resume` event:
  `src/protocol/socket.ts:343-389`, replay call at `:345`
  (`store.eventsAfter(m.sessionId, m.lastMessageId)`). **No `lastSeq` anywhere.**
  `JoinSession` is `src/protocol/types.ts:29-34` (`lastMessageId` at `:32`);
  `ServerEnvelope` is `:115-122` and has **no `seq`** field.
- **U3** web reconnect file is `packages/web/src/services/chatSocket.ts` (rejoin hook at
  `:62`, `join`/`emitJoin` at `:99-122`). All six call sites pass no cursor; the main
  one is `packages/web/src/app/app/[sessionUid]/TaskPageClient.tsx:205`. Wire type must
  be extended in both `packages/shared/src/socket.ts:22-27` and
  `src/protocol/types.ts:29-34`.
- **U4** **no boolean sensitive-tool flag exists.** Reuse risk tiers:
  `classifyToolCall` at `src/policy/riskTier.ts:385-418`, `SECRET_TOOL_NAMES` at
  `:248-258`, gate callers at `src/policy/permissionModes.ts:471`,
  `src/policy/permissionRules.ts:281`, `src/tools/planApprovalGate.ts:120`.
  BUILD_SPEC §10 U6 decision A is correct.
- **U5** tool start/finish emit sites in `src/agent/loop.ts`: `tool_call` at `:488`/`:534`,
  `tool_result` at `:519-525`/`:548`. **The loop never captures `call.id`**, so O5 must
