- touched tests (editHints, editSchemaAlias, multiEdit, readState, fileLock,
  diagnostics, findAndEdit)                         -> tests 96, pass 96, fail 0
- `node --import tsx --test "src/**/*.test.ts"`     -> tests 2163, pass 2161, fail 2
  (a third, load-sensitive failure appears in some runs; see item 3)
- `(cd packages/web && npx vitest run)`             -> 72 files / 472 tests, all pass
- `check:encoding` / `check:modes` / `check:orchestrator` (114/114) /
  `check:promptwire` / `check:recovery` / `check:design-registry` -> PASS

