`.jgatefail.txt` reported:

    MERGE CONFLICT with latest manus-parity: run git merge manus-parity, resolve all
    conflicts keeping both sides, commit.

Root cause: `manus-parity` advanced while N9's own commits (`3136f14`, `ed6376d`,
`1cdc5f4`, `c6c5ba6`) were landing, so this branch was no longer an ancestor of
parity and `git merge manus-parity` conflicted.

