  `flexibleMatchHint`, `applyEditOperations`, `formatEditFailures`,
  `resolveEditOperations`; constants `MAX_BATCH_EDITS` (50),
  `EDIT_CONTEXT_LINES` (3); rewritten `file_edit` schema + `run()`.
- `src/tools/__tests__/editHints.test.ts` - new, 23 tests.
- `src/tools/__tests__/editSchemaAlias.test.ts` - 2 assertions updated from the
  old wording to the ported messages (`/found 2 times/`, `/Provide more context/`,
  `/old_string not found in/`, `/file_read/`); nothing weakened.
- `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES` - added the `src/tools/files.ts` adaptation entry.

