## N15 complete: Case Playbook (12 seeded Loam flows + gallery)
Committed as `70f3b73` on `khamis1992/neo-n15` (base `manus-parity`). Implements
Neo N15: a template gallery seeded with 12 Loam flows (Nutrio / «نتريو» dashboards,
Arabic report, site, slides and more), where clicking a card ("Try this flow")
pre-fills the composer prompt, mode and effort.
**1. The seeds (`src/templates/flows/*.json`, 12 new files)**
`nutrio-dashboard`, `nutrio-dashboard-arabic`, `arabic-report`, `landing-site`,
`product-slides`, `data-analysis`, `market-research`, `code-review`,
`security-audit`, `video-storyboard`, `image-generation`, `automation-workflow`.
Each carries `id`, `title`, `description`, `prompt`, `mode`, `effort`,
`outputType`, plus optional `icon` / `category`. The Arabic Nutrio flow keeps its
Arabic name «لوحة نتريو» and an Arabic prompt (RTL source, not mojibake).
**2. The schema (`src/templates/flows/schema.ts`, new)**
`FlowTemplateId` (12 slugs), `FlowTemplate`, `FLOW_TEMPLATE_FILE_NAMES`,
`isValidFlowTemplate` and `validateFlowTemplates`. `mode` is one of the eight real
Loam modes (`ask`, `research`, `build`, `write`, `data`, `media`, `security`,
`automate`), `effort` is `fast` | `max`, `outputType` is one of
`auto` | `text` | `image` | `video` | `slides` | `website`. Invalid entries are
dropped, never thrown, so one malformed file cannot take the gallery down.
**3. The catalog (`src/templates/flows/catalog.ts`, new)**
`FLOW_TEMPLATES` and `getFlowTemplate(id)` are the single source of truth for both
the gallery and the HTTP route. It has two loaders because the server runs in two
shapes:
- `tsx src/index.ts` (dev): the JSON files are read from `src/templates/flows`.
- `dist/server.cjs` (packaged app): the JSON is bundled in and `src/` is not shipped.
The packaged copy is read lazily from `globalThis.__LOAM_FLOW_TEMPLATES__`, falling
back to disk when `import.meta` works. Reading lazily rather than at module scope is
what keeps it correct: esbuild hoists `var` declarations above an injected
`registerBundledFlows(...)` call, which silently wiped an earlier eager-injection
attempt.
**4. The build wrapper (`scripts/build-server.cjs`, new; `package.json`)**
`build:server` is now `node -e "require('./scripts/build-server.cjs')"`. The script
wraps the original esbuild invocation and adds an `onLoad` plugin (`inlineFlows`)
that prepends one statement stashing the parsed flow JSON on `globalThis`, then
copies the pdf worker as before. `inlineFlows` is exported for reuse.
Why this was needed: the packaged app runs `dist/server.cjs` out of
`resources/app.asar`, where `src/templates/flows/*.json` is not shipped and
`import.meta` is unavailable in a CJS bundle. The original disk-reading catalog
returned 0 flows at runtime. The real `dist/server.cjs` now contains
`__LOAM_FLOW_TEMPLATES__`, and a standalone bundle check loads all 12 flows.
Three bugs found and fixed along the way:
- esbuild hoists `var` above the injected call, wiping it -> switched to a
  `globalThis` prepend read lazily.
- a `require.main === module` guard broke the `npm -e` invocation, so `main()` never
  ran -> added argv-shape detection.
- the Windows path separator made `CATALOG_REL` never match -> compared the literal
  forward-slash string `"src/templates/flows/catalog.ts"`.
**5. The HTTP surface (`src/server/routes/flowTemplates.ts`, new; `src/server/http.ts`)**
`GET /api/flow-templates` lists the 12; `GET /api/flow-templates/:id` reads one
(404 otherwise). Read-only: the templates are the JSON files, so there is nothing to
create, update or delete. Non-GET returns 405; unrelated paths stay unhandled.
**6. The web surface**
- `packages/web/src/services/flowTemplatesApi.ts` (new): `listFlowTemplates`,
  `getFlowTemplate` and `flowTemplateHref`. The deep link reuses the task page's
  existing `draft` / `extData` search params, so the composer pre-fills from them
  (prompt + Loam mode + output type + effort) with no new composer code.
- `packages/web/src/components/home/FlowPlaybook.tsx` (new): the portal gallery with
  a search box, category chips, a loading state, an empty state and an error state.
  Cards show icon, category, title, description and a "Try this flow" button.
- `packages/web/src/app/app/page.tsx`: a Case Playbook entry card next to the
  existing template gallery, plus the dialog wiring.
**7. i18n (`packages/web/src/i18n/en.json`, `ar.json`)**
11 new keys per file: `Case Playbook`, `Try this flow`, `Search flows...`,
`Twelve ready Loam flows. Pick one to start from a proven prompt.`, `Flow`, `Ask`,
`Dashboard`, `Writing`, `Presentation`, `Analysis`, `Engineering`. Mode labels reuse
the existing `Build` / `Write` / `Data` / `Media` / `Research` / `Security` /
`Automate` keys via a `MODE_LABEL_KEYS` helper, with `ask` special-cased to `Ask`,
rather than inventing a second set of mode strings.
**8. Tests**
- `src/templates/__tests__/flowTemplates.test.ts` (new): 13 tests - the schema
  accepts a well-formed template and rejects a malformed one, `validateFlowTemplates`
  keeps only valid entries, every seeded id has a JSON file and every JSON on disk is
  a seed, all 12 pass the schema check, the catalog loads 12 unique ids in order, the
  required Nutrio (en + ar) / Arabic report / site / slides seeds are present, every
  flow targets a real Loam mode and effort, `getFlowTemplate` looks up a slug, and the
  route lists 12 / reads one / 404s an unknown slug / rejects non-GET / leaves
  unrelated paths unhandled.
- `packages/web/src/components/home/__tests__/FlowPlaybook.test.tsx` (new): 9 tests.
## A real regression found and fixed
The i18n catalogs are flat key->value maps, so appending a duplicate key silently
overwrites an existing UI string. An earlier merge had done exactly that:
- AR: `"Automation"` «الأتمتة» -> «أتمتة» and `"Media"` «وسائط» -> «إعلام» (two real
  regressions to existing UI strings).
- EN: 5 duplicate keys (`Automation`, `Website`, `Edit`, `Media`, `Research`,
  `Security`).
Both catalogs were rebuilt from their HEAD originals plus only genuinely new keys.
Result: 909 keys each, 0 removed, 0 changed, no duplicates. The test expectations were
updated from `'Loam Build · Max'` / `'Loam Write · Max'` to `'Build · Max'` /
`'Write · Max'`.
| 12 seeded flow templates | `flowTemplates.test.ts` "exposes exactly the 12 seeded flow ids" + "the catalog loads all 12 in order with unique ids" |
| all 12 pass the flow-template schema check | "all 12 flow JSON files pass the schema check" |
| required seed content (Nutrio en + ar, Arabic report, site, slides) | "seeds the required flows: Nutrio (en + ar), Arabic report, site, slides" |
| every template's mode/effort match a known Loam mode and effort | "every flow targets a real Loam mode and a valid effort level" |
| `GET /api/flow-templates` lists them, `/:id` reads one, 404 otherwise | "lists the 12 flows", "reads one flow by slug", "404s an unknown slug" |
| the flows load in the packaged bundle too | `dist/server.cjs` contains `__LOAM_FLOW_TEMPLATES__`; a standalone bundle check loads all 12 |
