  mentions auto-layout "via dagre/elk". N2 ships an **original layered-grid
  layout** in `canvas/layout.ts`; no dagre, elk or graphlib dependency exists
  in `packages/web/package.json` and none was added. The acceptance rule
  ("Organize lays out without overlap") is satisfied by construction and pinned
  by `hasOverlaps` plus the distinct-transform assertion. A dagre/elk layout
  can still be dropped in behind the same `applyLayout` signature through the
  `layoutOptions` seam; that is left to whoever needs force-directed spacing.
