  index entries.

No secrets committed. No forbidden path touched. No test weakened, deleted or skipped.
No `.neo-*` or `.jcode-*` marker file was staged.
## J1 - merge gate resolution (final round, parity `519f889`)

`.jgatefail.txt` reported:

> MERGE CONFLICT with latest manus-parity: run `git merge manus-parity`, resolve all
> conflicts keeping both sides, commit.

Parity advanced repeatedly during this session (`109617a` -> `495ac5f` -> `ca08d4c` ->
`519f889`), so the merge was performed in successive rounds, each on the newest tip. No test
was weakened, deleted or skipped; no source file needed editing for this gate.

### Merge rounds (every conflict kept both sides)
- `3a2cda3` - merge `109617a`: `.jdone` + `.jcode-done` (modify/delete), `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES`,
  `bench/README.md`, `package.json` (content). Resolved with a line-union for the two marker
  files and by hand for the rest; `package.json` deduped (`vendor`, `bench:mem`, `test:bench`)
  with `test:bench` the union of both sides' file lists.
- `65c141a` - merge `495ac5f`: `.jdone` + `.jcode-done` (add/add, no merge base, so the
  `merge=union` driver does not apply). Resolved by concatenating stage-2 (ours) + stage-3
  (theirs) and proving the superset property.
- `cc5de13` - merge `ca08d4c`: `.jdone` alone, auto-merged by the `merge=union` driver.
- `6885739` - merge `839e7cc`: auto-merged, no conflicts.
- `87fc429` - merge `519f889` (final): `.jdone` (union driver) + `package.json` (auto).

`.gitattributes` carries `.jdone merge=union` / `.jcode-done merge=union`, so from `cc5de13`
onward the rollup merges automatically. Integrity of the final rollup (33420 lines):
- parent1 (`cc5de13`) subset of merged: true, 0 lines missing;
- parent2 (`519f889`) subset of merged: true, 0 lines missing;
- conflict markers 0; no BOM; no lone CR; trailing newline present.

